WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.833
Not cool, dude.

00:00:01.917 --> 00:00:04.750
You went from ghosting us
to being frankly a little clingy.

00:00:05.292 --> 00:00:06.667
Ah, come on. That tickles.

00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:08.750
Come on, Banana.
We gotta find Panthar.

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.833
How? It’s not like he’s just gonna fall
out of the sky.

00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:12.417
[Panthar] What’s up, guys--

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.333
I stand corrected.

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:14.625
I could really use that help.

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:15.625
Come on, we gotta help him.

00:00:15.708 --> 00:00:17.583
Against the shroud-infested flying Batman?

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:18.083
Excuse me?

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:18.875
Man who’s a bat?

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:19.375
That’s better.

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:20.333
Time's a wastin'!

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.292
Come on! We’re gonna need reinforcements.

00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:23.667
Looks like we’re going up.

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:25.208
[growls]

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:27.625
That doesn’t sound like you, man.
That’s not the Echo Wing I know.

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:29.042
[growling]

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:31.542
Well, maybe I would know you
if you hadn’t taken off on us.

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:32.875
Now put me down!

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.083
Admittedly, bad choice of words.

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:37.042
Hey!

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:38.708
Is this the only way back up?

00:00:38.792 --> 00:00:40.125
How many stairs are there
in this place?

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:42.167
The elevator got destroyed, remember?

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.542
My thighs remember.

00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:46.833
Stop smashing me into the floor door!

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:50.042
Huh? Where am I?

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:52.250
Panthar, get away!
This is part of their plan!

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:53.292
Plan? What plan?

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.333
You gotta get away from me.

00:00:54.417 --> 00:00:55.875
I’ve been possessed by the Shroud.

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:58.458
And they want a-- [growls]

00:00:58.542 --> 00:00:59.583
Uh-oh…

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:00.958
Here we go again.

00:01:01.292 --> 00:01:02.458
Dangit, there's the ice machine.

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:03.833
I can never find the bucket.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:07.708
Hello and welcome back
to the Swarm Maker 6000.

00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:08.875
Reinforcement time!

00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:10.708
Let’s make ourselves an army.

00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.500
Come, my brothers.
We’re going to save Panthar.

00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:15.250
[growls] Hurhhh!

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:16.208
[grunts]

00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:17.792
Heavy metal time!

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:18.458
[growls]

00:01:18.542 --> 00:01:20.625
Let’s see how it feels to get bussed out.

00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:21.708
Banana would have loved that.

00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:23.375
You got left out in the cold.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.542
Ah, I got greedy.

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:26.542
Alright, let’s get this gooey stuff
out of you.

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:29.208
Get away from me!
This is what they want.

00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:30.875
Just because you gave up
on our friendship

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:32.458
doesn’t mean I’m willing
to give up on…

00:01:32.542 --> 00:01:33.875
Ours. Damn it.

00:01:33.958 --> 00:01:34.875
No, wait! Agh--

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:35.833
[blabbering]

00:01:35.917 --> 00:01:37.917
Oh, man. Looks like
the bad guy break’s over.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:38.833
Eughhh!

00:01:40.125 --> 00:01:42.375
Hey, second tier bad guy.
We’re going to save Panthar, you in?

00:01:42.458 --> 00:01:43.458
No way. I’m your greatest foe.

00:01:43.542 --> 00:01:44.708
Oh, I’m just kidding.
Hold up, guys.

00:01:45.417 --> 00:01:47.583
Hey Spike and/or Sprout,
we’re going to save Panthar.

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:48.458
I’m in.

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:50.250
Hey, come on, we’re--
Nevermind.

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:51.000
‘Sup.

00:01:51.917 --> 00:01:53.292
Hey, Popcorn guy. We’re hungry.

00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:54.083
Hey!

00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:56.458
Beastbot, we need your help.
Panthar’s in trouble.

00:01:56.542 --> 00:01:58.708
Haha, I know.
I’ve been watching on the screen.

00:01:58.792 --> 00:01:59.542
And you didn’t come
and help?

00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:00.792
I didn’t hear a "Please."

00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:01.750
I hate you so much…

00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:03.000
Come on, we got a lot of stairs
to cover.

00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:05.208
Stairs? Let’s just take
the freight elevator.

00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:06.333
I hate you so much…

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.750
I’ve had just about enough
of the door smashing.

00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:12.333
But I’m not giving up on you.

00:02:12.417 --> 00:02:13.583
[Shroud-infested noises]

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:15.667
True, but you forgot one thing.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.458
My gross, disgusting swamp friend,

00:02:17.542 --> 00:02:19.000
who doesn’t leave, by the way,

00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:20.708
gave me the power of healing.

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.208
Panthar, no!
This was their plan.

00:02:26.292 --> 00:02:27.542
They have control of you now.

00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:29.875
No way.
Nothing’s got control of me.

00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:32.125
I mean, there’s a couple of K-pop songs,
I guess--

00:02:32.208 --> 00:02:33.083
Oh, come on!

00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:34.792
Ahh!

00:02:40.042 --> 00:02:41.625
Alright, everybody.
This is where it landed.

00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:44.375
God, Echo Wing,
you scared the crap out of me.

00:02:44.458 --> 00:02:45.625
Wait, are you still a bad guy?

00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:47.042
Something terrible’s happened.

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:48.125
I’m… I’m sorry.

00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:49.500
Oh, thank goodness.
It’s Panthar.

00:02:49.583 --> 00:02:50.208
Hey, Panthar!

00:02:50.292 --> 00:02:51.583
Hey, guys…

00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:53.208
[growling] Hey, guys…

00:02:53.292 --> 00:02:56.083
[snarls] Hang on…

00:02:56.667 --> 00:02:59.250
Oh, way to go, Echo Wing.
Now you got Panthar swearing.

00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:03.333
[growling]

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.333
Holy cliffhanger, Batman.

00:03:05.417 --> 00:03:06.417
-Man who’s a bat.
-Sorry.

